	(footprint "pluto_rx2_8way_v2:QFN-24_4x4_P0.5_EP2.7_PE42482"
		(layer "F.Cu")
		(uuid "38cbda3b-b460-4aa3-91ef-73b40c7d601f")
		(at 41 49)
		(descr "pSemi PE42482A-X, 24-lead 4.00 x 4.00 x 0.85 mm QFN, 0.50 mm pitch. Land pattern AUTHORED from the RECOMMENDED LAND PATTERN inset of Figure 23 'Package Mechanical Drawing for 24-lead 4 x 4 x 0.85 mm QFN', DOC-75785-4 PDF p21: pad 0.30 x 0.60 (x24), pitch 0.50 (x20), land envelope 4.40, exposed-pad land 2.75 sq. Pin numbering per Figure 22 'Pin Configuration (Top View)' PDF p20 - pin-1 dot at the TOP-LEFT corner, CCW: 1-6 down the left column, 7-12 across the bottom, 13-18 up the right, 19-24 across the top. Pad 25 is the EXPOSED PAD and it is an RF GROUND RETURN, not a thermal pad (Table 8 last row: 'Exposed pad: ground for proper operation'); its paste is a 3x3 window-pane at 66.9 pct coverage (DERIVED per IPC-7093 - pSemi publishes no stencil recommendation). Board stage owns the EP via array to L2.")
